# Only lab/Dockerfile builds from the repository root (`make images`); the api and worker images build
# from backend/build/docker, which holds only the jar. An allow-list: everything is left out of the
# build context except what lab/Dockerfile copies, so .env, .secrets/, .localdata/, fixtures/clips/,
# app/, backend/build/ and every node_modules/ never reach the Docker daemon.
**
!lab/pyproject.toml
!lab/uv.lock
!lab/README.md
!lab/src/
!contracts/ranking/
**/__pycache__/
